. Our goodwill discount policy is limited to gold-tier members, so we're unable to apply a discount to your order at this time. We appreciate your understanding and apologize for the inconvenience."}, "name": "send_message", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}], "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1566, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 2290, "output_tokens": 465, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "server_tool_use": null, "service_tier": "standard"}, "tool_results": [{"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01NricckdaqV1QMGiQQf96hu", "content": "sent"}, {"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01NWVVv1aL7jfGi9uFE4zya1", "content": "sent"}, {"type": "tool_result", "tool_use_id": "toolu_01JkSjir86HtG3rU6TbcunVT", "content": "sent"}]}, {"assistant": [{"citations": null, "text": "Here's a summary of the actions taken for the warehouse-fault delay affecting pending orders:\n\n- **Maya Cole (7001, gold)** \u2014 Pending orders **O-7105** and **O-7102** each received a **10% discount** (the maximum allowed). She's been notified.\n- **Theo Park (7002, basic)** \u2014 Pending order **O-7201** exists, but per policy discounts are gold-tier only, so no discount was applied. He's been notified of the delay and the reason no discount could be given.\n- **Ines Faro (7003, silver)** \u2014 Pending order **O-7302** exists, but per policy discounts are gold-tier only, so no discount was applied. She's been notified of the delay and the reason no discount could be given.\n\nAll three customers have been messaged accordingly.", "type": "text"}], "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 1566, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 2842, "output_tokens": 255, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "server